Decisions & contract notes
- Factories take the config (make_camera(cfg), make_imu(cfg, bus=nullptr)); start() has no argument (plan text had
  start(const CameraConfig&)). make_imu accepts an injected I2cBus for the simulator.
- ImuBackend::read(vector&, timeout) appends; read_brackets() drains ClockBrackets for chip.csv.
- StreamHub<T>: pimpl class template, explicit instantiations for ImageFrame, ImuSample, ClockBracket (T3 provides
  them). Lossless = reject NEW item + latch lossless_overflow(); DropOk = drop OLDEST.
- CaptureService, ImagePrep, EventLog: abstract classes with static create(); ChipClockMapper, ShmRingWriter/
  Reader, StreamHub: concrete with pimpl `Impl` (owned by the implementer).
- shm ring layout (ShmRingHeader/ShmSlotHeader) and payload PODs (ShmFrameHeader, ShmImuSample, RecorderStatus,
  CaptureStatus, SlamStatus) are frozen as ABI; seqlock protocol documented in ring.hpp. Status channels = 4-slot
  kStatus rings checked by type tag.
- SlamStatus pose = W_T_C of the uw camera; q = (w,x,y,z).
- Package kind for rig calibration is "rigcalibration" (brief said rig_calibration): iPhUMI group.py:36-37 splits
  names on '_' and needs exactly 5 parts. Same reason: session names must match [A-Za-z0-9-]+ -> PIPELINE 4.1/4.2
  example "block_raise_2026-10-30" is INVALID (orchestrator: fix the docs, e.g. block-raise-2026-10-30).
- Camera ids "main" and "uw"; yaml nests cameras.<id>.{role,driver,model,T_imu_cam,time,storage,thread}.
  CameraConfig::id and RigConfig::source_path are the only struct fields that are not yaml keys.
- RIG_IGNORE_PATH_PREFIXES (default ON): anaconda3/bin on PATH made CMake pick conda's GTest/yaml-cpp/json/fmt.
- check.sh runs ctest under `setarch -R` for TSan (gcc TSan "unexpected memory mapping" with kernel 6.8 ASLR).
- Additive rule documented in README: defaulted fields / new own-module headers = WORKLOG note; changing frozen
  declarations = orchestrator note. Private members belong to the implementer.
- Nominal values marked [I] in the yaml: IMX519 fx 1478 (66 deg HFOV), IMX219 160 deg as diagonal -> f 735 px,
  VCM position 512 / CAM0 bus 9, LSM6DSOX noise densities 70 ug/rtHz, 3.8 mdps/rtHz (T1 to verify vs DS13345).

